{"id":"behaupten","lemma":"behaupten","pos":"verb","rank":1765,"glosses":["to claim, maintain, assert","to stand one's ground"],"ipa":"/bəˈhaʊ̯ptən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8b/De-behaupten.ogg/De-behaupten.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"behaupte","1p":"behaupten","2s":"behauptest","2p":"behauptet","3s":"behauptet","3p":"behaupten"},"preterite":{"1s":"behauptete","1p":"behaupteten","2s":"behauptetest","2p":"behauptetet","3s":"behauptete","3p":"behaupteten"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe behauptet","1p":"haben behauptet","2s":"hast behauptet","2p":"habt behauptet","3s":"hat behauptet","3p":"haben behauptet"},"future":{"1s":"werde behaupten","1p":"werden behaupten","2s":"wirst behaupten","2p":"werdet behaupten","3s":"wird behaupten","3p":"werden behaupten"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"behaupt","2p":"behauptet"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde behaupten","1p":"würden behaupten","2s":"würdest behaupten","2p":"würdet behaupten","3s":"würde behaupten","3p":"würden behaupten"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"behauptet"},"examples":[{"text":"Das kann ich nicht behaupten.","en":"I can't say that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/90728","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Manche behaupten, alles zu wissen.","en":"Some people claim to know everything.","words":[{"g":"many a","l":"manch"},null,{"g":"everything"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to know"}]},{"text":"Ich behaupte nicht, dass du irgendetwas getan hast.","en":"I'm not suggesting that you did anything.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"anything"},{"g":"to do","l":"tun"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Ich habe nichts von dem, was du behauptest, getan.","en":"I didn't do any of the things you said I did.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"you